    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Wall distribution box shown with its door open: three DIN rows of breakers, a red main isolator group, terminals, gland plate, hinges, door latch and a warning label. Rear and side views show a fully closed enclosure with mounting flange. Carries an invented POWERHAVEN wordmark on the back panel plus generic hazard and specification labels.",
    "limitations": [
      "Invented POWERHAVEN brand mark is baked into the texture; remove or overpaint it for brand-sensitive use.",
      "Not rigged in the shipped glTF; the door cannot be opened or closed at runtime.",
      "Breaker toggles are static geometry."
    ],
